*** The examples of the ticket ***
implicit_hydrogens/ticket-pyrrole.svg:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/ticket-hexamethyl-sulfur.svg:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/ticket-hexane.svg:SUCCEED
*** A terminal atom has its hydrogens opposite its bond ***
implicit_hydrogens/terminal-atoms.svg:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/near-vertical-bonds.svg:SUCCEED
*** An atom without bonds has them where its formula is written ***
implicit_hydrogens/atoms-without-bonds.svg:SUCCEED
*** An internal atom has them in the first free quadrant ***
implicit_hydrogens/internal-atoms.svg:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/bonds-on-diagonals.svg:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/piperazine.svg:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/three-and-four-bonds.svg:SUCCEED
*** Hydrogens above the symbol shorten the lines that reach them ***
implicit_hydrogens/hydrogens-beside-bonds.svg:SUCCEED
*** A radical takes the top quadrant ***
implicit_hydrogens/radicals.svg:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/radical-kinds.svg:SUCCEED
*** A radical stands where no bond passes ***
implicit_hydrogens/radicals-with-bond-up.svg:SUCCEED
implicit_hydrogens/radical-places.svg:SUCCEED
*** A charge stands to the right of a hydrogen count above it ***
implicit_hydrogens/charge-beside-stacked-hydrogens.svg:SUCCEED
